* The integral comparison for the zeta series, indexed by the summation variable itself.

s1::simpl |- ( ( ( T e. RR /\ 1 < T ) /\ ( M e. NN /\ N e. ( ZZ>= ` M ) ) ) -> ( T e. RR /\ 1 < T ) )
