s49:s48:sumeq2dv |- ( ( ( T e. RR /\ 1 < T ) /\ ( M e. NN /\ N e. ( ZZ>= ` M ) ) ) -> sum_ k e. ( ( M + 1 ) ... N ) ( ( ( k - 1 ) + 1 ) ^c -u T ) = sum_ k e. ( ( M + 1 ) ... N ) ( k ^c -u T ) )
